**Findings**
- `SHOULD-FIX` `src/parser/plan-document.ts:495`: `detectYamlUnsafeValues()` includes `title` in the allowed fields, but the regex only matches lines that begin with whitespace + field name. In the imported YAML format, titles are typically `- title: ...`, so unquoted colons in titles (`- title: Error: invalid`) will not be detected and the new hint won’t appear.

